+    .. seealso::
+    MuJoCo's implementation:
+    https://github.com/google-deepmind/mujoco/blob/7dc7a349c5ba2db2d3f8ab50a367d08e2f1afbbc/src/engine/engine_collision_gjk.c#L2259
